00:48:46.960 --> 00:48:48.940
I like it to be, like, even strings.
我喜欢撕得均匀一点。

1338
00:48:49.460 --> 00:48:49.780
Okay.
好吧。

1339
00:48:49.800 --> 00:48:52.000
I open it and just bite it off.
我打开包装直接咬一口。

1340
00:48:54.260 --> 00:48:56.340
This says everything about us, I feel like.
我觉得这说明了一切关于我们的事。

1341
00:48:56.840 --> 00:48:58.940
I don't have time to string it out.
我没时间把它撕成条。

1342
00:48:59.160 --> 00:49:00.880
Guys, how do you eat your string cheese?
各位，你们是怎么吃手撕奶酪的？

1343
00:49:01.020 --> 00:49:01.860
Yeah, we want to know.
是的，我们想知道。

1344
00:49:01.860 --> 00:49:02.060
Will you let us know?
你们能告诉我们吗？

1345
00:49:02.060 --> 00:49:02.960
Will you comment us?
你们能评论告诉我们吗？

1346
00:49:03.120 --> 00:49:04.860
Do you string it or do you bite it?
你们是撕着吃还是直接咬？

1347
00:49:04.860 --> 00:49:05.640
Or do you bite it?
还是说你们直接咬？

1348
00:49:05.740 --> 00:49:06.620
Jenna's a stringer.
珍娜是撕着吃派的。

1349
00:49:06.680 --> 00:49:07.320
I'm a biter.
我是直接咬派的。

1350
00:49:07.400 --> 00:49:09.820
I'm going to do a poll and we'll tell you the results.
我会发起一个投票，然后把结果告诉你们。

1351
00:49:10.060 --> 00:49:10.360
Okay.
好的。

1352
00:49:11.520 --> 00:49:13.960
So, Michael eventually makes it into the bathroom.
所以，迈克尔最终进了洗手间。

1353
00:49:13.960 --> 00:49:22.100
And then you overhear him falling into the toilet, demanding that Pam help him, demanding that Ryan help him.
然后你听到他掉进马桶里，要求帕姆帮他，要求瑞安帮他。

1354
00:49:22.400 --> 00:49:29.680
This was all basically scripted except for it was in the script that Michael is supposed to say, get Ryan.
这基本上都是按剧本演的，除了剧本里迈克尔原本应该说的是“叫瑞安来”。

1355
00:49:30.400 --> 00:49:38.020
But then Steve improvised, he needs to lift me and he needs to clean me up a little bit, bring a wet towel.
但史蒂夫即兴发挥说，他需要把我扶起来，还需要帮我清理一下，拿条湿毛巾来。

1356
00:49:38.400 --> 00:49:42.360
And I think you can see Paul start to break at the end.
我想你们能看出保罗在最后开始憋不住笑了。

1357
00:49:42.520 --> 00:49:43.800
Oh, no, you totally can.
噢，不，你绝对能看出来。

1358
00:49:43.920 --> 00:49:44.160
Right.
没错。

1359
00:49:44.380 --> 00:49:45.080
For sure.
肯定的。

1360
00:49:45.340 --> 00:49:47.960
I watched this scene a few times because I was like, Paul is breaking.
我看了好几遍这一幕，因为我当时就在想，保罗要破功了。

1361
00:49:48.160 --> 00:49:48.960
Paul is breaking.
保罗要破功了。

1362
00:49:49.220 --> 00:49:54.740
At 9 minutes, 46 seconds, he starts to laugh and he turns away from camera and kind of leaves.
在9分46秒的时候，他开始笑，然后转过身背对镜头，差不多要走开了。

1363
00:49:54.840 --> 00:49:55.160
He does.
确实是。

1364
00:49:55.220 --> 00:49:59.620
And then the camera, because our camera guys would do this quite often for us when they would see that we were starting to break.
然后摄像机，因为我们的摄影师经常会这样做，当他们看到我们快要笑场的时候。

1365
00:49:59.720 --> 00:50:00.860
They'd whip away from us.
他们会迅速把镜头移开。

1366
00:50:00.880 --> 00:50:01.200
They would.
他们确实会。

1367
00:50:08.020 --> 00:50:14.100
Michael fall for the second time because that was also not in the script and I think it was too much for Paul.
迈克尔第二次摔倒，因为那也不是剧本里的，我觉得这对保罗来说太好笑了。

1368
00:50:14.440 --> 00:50:17.900
Well, Steve was in there clanging around like making noises and stuff.
嗯，史蒂夫在里面叮叮当当地弄出各种声音之类的。

1369
00:50:18.500 --> 00:50:19.700
It was very funny.
那真的非常搞笑。

1370
00:50:20.220 --> 00:50:20.720
All right.
好吧。

1371
00:50:20.960 --> 00:50:26.680
So, next, Jim and Pam are out in the bullpen and they're discussing Dwight.
接下来，吉姆和帕姆在办公区讨论德怀特。

