他气坏了。

1374
00:50:33.780 --> 00:50:35.440
I remember shooting that scene.
我记得拍那一幕的时候。

1375
00:50:35.760 --> 00:50:40.140
He is so angry now that no one is taking care of him or treating him special.
他现在非常生气，因为没人照顾他，也没人对他特殊对待。

1376
00:50:40.660 --> 00:50:46.820
And a lot of fans mentioned that one of their favorite lines is Stanley's line when Michael says,
很多粉丝提到他们最喜欢的台词之一是斯坦利的台词，当时迈克尔说，

1377
00:50:46.960 --> 00:50:48.440
what does this look like to you?
你们觉得这看起来像什么？

1378
00:50:48.580 --> 00:50:50.560
And Stanley says, mailboxes, et cetera.
斯坦利说，邮箱之类的。

1379
00:50:51.500 --> 00:50:55.360
And then Steve does that thing that I love where he's like, shut it.
然后史蒂夫做了那个我超爱的动作，他说，闭嘴。

1380
00:50:55.760 --> 00:50:56.340
Yes.
是的。

1381
00:50:56.500 --> 00:50:57.980
That's Steve right there.
那确实是史蒂夫的风格。

1382
00:50:58.600 --> 00:51:05.200
So, you know, at the end of that scene, Dwight turns to Creed and says, dad, that was added on the day.
所以，你知道，在那一幕的结尾，德怀特转向克里德说“爸爸”，那是当天加进去的。

1383
00:51:05.360 --> 00:51:06.420
That was an improv on the day.
那是当天的即兴发挥。

1384
00:51:06.640 --> 00:51:07.820
It was probably an alt.
那可能是一个备选方案。

1385
00:51:08.020 --> 00:51:09.540
They would do that to us sometimes.
他们有时会那样对我们。

1386
00:51:09.580 --> 00:51:12.680
They would have alternate endings to scenes.
他们会给场景准备备选结局。

1387
00:51:13.080 --> 00:51:18.120
In the script, Dwight was supposed to pick up his phone and say hello, even though it didn't ring.
剧本里，德怀特本应该拿起电话说“喂”，尽管电话根本没响。

1388
00:51:18.640 --> 00:51:21.080
Well, Creed being his dad is way better.
嗯，克里德是他爸爸这个设定好多了。

1389
00:51:21.300 --> 00:51:21.780
Perfect.
完美。

1390
00:51:22.040 --> 00:51:22.340
Perfect.
完美。

1391
00:51:23.080 --> 00:51:23.740
All right.
好吧。

1392
00:51:23.900 --> 00:51:31.580
So this moves us into the conference room meeting where Michael has hung a bunch of photos of disabled people on the wall.
接下来是会议室的会议，迈克尔在墙上挂了一堆残疾人的照片。

1393
00:51:31.820 --> 00:51:32.360
Icons.
偶像。

1394
00:51:32.880 --> 00:51:33.420
Icons.
偶像。

1395
00:51:33.640 --> 00:51:33.860
Yes.
是的。

1396
00:51:34.240 --> 00:51:36.260
Including two pictures of Tom Hanks.
包括两张汤姆·汉克斯的照片。

1397
00:51:36.380 --> 00:51:39.940
Tom Hanks in Forrest Gump and then Tom Hanks in Big.
《阿甘正传》里的汤姆·汉克斯，还有《飞越未来》里的汤姆·汉克斯。

1398
00:51:40.200 --> 00:51:40.480
Yeah.
没错。

1399
00:51:40.680 --> 00:51:42.020
But he thinks it's in Philadelphia.
但他以为那是《费城故事》里的。

1400
00:51:42.020 --> 00:51:44.800
And then there's like a debate that it's definitely big.
然后就有一场争论，说那绝对是《飞越未来》。

1401
00:51:44.940 --> 00:51:50.800
It's definitely big, but he says it still counts because he became a man overnight, which is a type of disability.
这确实很大，但他坚持说这依然算数，因为他一夜之间就长成了大人，这算是一种残疾。

1402
00:51:51.240 --> 00:51:51.660
Ugh.
呃。

1403
00:51:51.660 --> 00:51:55.660
11 minutes, 56 seconds, tracking Mindy.
11分56秒，追踪明迪。

1404
00:51:56.580 --> 00:51:58.180
Her hair looks fantastic.
她的发型看起来棒极了。

1405
00:51:58.480 --> 00:51:59.560
Her hair is fantastic.
她的发型确实很棒。

1406
00:51:59.560 --> 00:52:02.420
I have it on a note card, but it is half up and half down.
我记在卡片上了，是半扎半披的。

