1489
00:55:09.100 --> 00:55:09.780
I have both of those.
这两个镜头我都有。

1490
00:55:09.900 --> 00:55:11.260
I'm like, Jenna, you completely break.
我就说，珍娜，你完全破功了。

1491
00:55:11.540 --> 00:55:12.820
Mindy, I expect to.
明迪的话，我倒是有心理准备。

1492
00:55:12.880 --> 00:55:15.020
I expect to see Mindy's hand cover her mouth.
我预料到明迪会用手捂住嘴。

1493
00:55:15.100 --> 00:55:16.620
But you don't even hide it.
但你连掩饰都不掩饰。

1494
00:55:16.720 --> 00:55:17.040
I don't.
我确实没有。

1495
00:55:17.120 --> 00:55:18.500
You just turn and start laughing.
你直接转过身就开始大笑。

1496
00:55:18.500 --> 00:55:20.960
Well, Brian is staring at the floor.
好吧，布莱恩当时正盯着地板看。

1497
00:55:21.240 --> 00:55:22.080
Brian is Kevin.
布莱恩就是凯文。

1498
00:55:22.420 --> 00:55:23.340
He's having a hard time.
他当时忍得很辛苦。

1499
00:55:23.540 --> 00:55:30.380
He has got just, like, this laser focus onto the carpet, which seems also unnatural.
他就像是用激光般的专注力盯着地毯，看起来也挺不自然的。

1500
00:55:30.380 --> 00:55:32.000
And I think he's doing it not to laugh.
我觉得他那样做是为了不让自己笑出来。

1501
00:55:32.000 --> 00:55:36.980
No, he's also probably biting the inside of his mouth or inflicting some kind of pain on himself.
不，他可能还在咬自己的嘴唇内侧，或者在对自己施加某种痛苦。

1502
00:55:36.980 --> 00:55:37.880
So he doesn't laugh.
这样他就不会笑场了。

1503
00:55:38.060 --> 00:55:45.080
I wanted to point out that I think it's really sweet how the director chose to put Rain and I next to each other in that conference room scene.
我想指出的是，我觉得导演选择让雷恩和我坐在那场会议室戏的隔壁，真的很贴心。

1504
00:55:45.080 --> 00:55:50.100
I would normally sit next to Jim, but I sat next to Dwight because Pam and Dwight are friends.
我通常会坐在吉姆旁边，但我坐在了德怀特旁边，因为帕姆和德怀特是朋友。

1505
00:55:50.340 --> 00:55:51.460
Yes, they're friends now.
是的，他们现在是朋友了。

1506
00:55:51.700 --> 00:55:56.280
Also in this scene, we learn that I guess Michael brushes his teeth for 10 seconds.
同样是在这场戏里，我们了解到迈克尔刷牙大概只刷10秒钟。

1507
00:55:56.400 --> 00:55:56.580
Yeah.
没错。

1508
00:55:58.400 --> 00:55:59.440
10 seconds.
10秒钟。

1509
00:55:59.520 --> 00:56:00.080
Wow.
哇。

1510
00:56:00.360 --> 00:56:00.740
Okay.
好吧。

1511
00:56:01.060 --> 00:56:07.220
So next we go to a scene with Michael and Ryan, and Ryan is delivering him some pudding.
接下来是迈克尔和瑞恩的一场戏，瑞恩给他送布丁。

1512
00:56:07.520 --> 00:56:08.460
Chocolate pudding.
巧克力布丁。

1513
00:56:08.460 --> 00:56:13.620
It's revealed that Ryan ground up some aspirin and put it in the pudding.
剧情揭示了瑞恩把阿司匹林磨碎放进了布丁里。

1514
00:56:13.820 --> 00:56:21.420
And so there's been this runner where Michael really, really wants some fresh yams, and Ryan can't seem to find them anywhere.
一直有个贯穿剧情的梗，就是迈克尔非常、非常想吃新鲜山药，而瑞恩似乎到处都找不到。

1515
00:56:21.680 --> 00:56:27.560
He asked them if he found them in Carbondale, which is where he found the pudding at a gas station in Carbondale.
他问他们是不是在卡本代尔找到的，因为他就是在卡本代尔的一家加油站找到的布丁。

1516
00:56:27.860 --> 00:56:33.360
Fan question from Grellet, does a gas station in Carbondale always have fresh yams?
来自Grellet的粉丝提问，卡本代尔的加油站真的总是有新鲜山药吗？

1517
00:56:33.520 --> 00:56:34.700
I wanted to find out.
我想去一探究竟。

1518
00:56:34.700 --> 00:56:37.300
I would think that no gas station had yaMs.
我觉得应该没有加油站会卖山药。

1519
00:56:37.580 --> 00:56:42.980
I feel like Ryan isn't really trying that hard to look for these yams, because I think if he just went to the grocery store.
我觉得瑞恩并没有真的很努力地去找这些山药，因为我觉得如果他直接去杂货店的话。

1520
00:56:43.680 --> 00:56:46.960
Carbondale is about 25 minutes outside of Scranton.
卡本代尔距离斯克兰顿大约25分钟车程。

1521
00:56:47.380 --> 00:56:53.000
Ryan hits a number of the sort of surrounding counties on his search for the yaMs.
瑞恩为了找山药，跑了好几个周边县区。

1522
00:56:53.760 --> 00:57:01.100
So I really looked hard, and I could not find a gas station with yams in Carbondale.
所以我真的很努力地找了，但在卡本代尔我没能找到一家卖山药的加油站。

1523
00:57:01.280 --> 00:57:04.640
And most of them didn't even look like they had quick shops.
而且它们大多数看起来甚至连便利店都没有。

1524
00:57:04.900 --> 00:57:09.280
Like, maybe you could get gum, but some of them I felt like I couldn't even get a cup of coffee.
比如，也许你能买到口香糖，但有些地方我觉得连杯咖啡都买不到。

1525
00:57:09.480 --> 00:57:14.120
If you live in Carbondale, Pennsylvania, let me know.
如果你住在宾夕法尼亚州的卡本代尔，请告诉我。

1526
00:57:14.120 --> 00:57:17.200
And if there's a gas station near you that sells yams, will you tell us?
如果你附近有卖山药的加油站，能告诉我们吗？

1527
00:57:17.820 --> 00:57:18.600
We'd love to know.
我们很想知道。

1528
00:57:19.760 --> 00:57:21.200
Jenna, I have a question for you.
珍娜，我有个问题想问你。

1529
00:57:21.200 --> 00:57:21.780
What is it?
什么问题？

1530
00:57:22.820 --> 00:57:24.220
How do I say this?
我该怎么说呢？

1531
00:57:24.400 --> 00:57:24.520
Yeah.
嗯。

1532
00:57:25.220 --> 00:57:25.620
Oh, no.
噢，不。

1533
00:57:28.540 --> 00:57:35.520
Did you ever think that you would stay up late looking for yams at gas stations in Carbondale?
你有没有想过，自己会熬夜在卡本代尔的加油站寻找山药？

1534
00:57:35.840 --> 00:57:36.220
No.
没有。

1535
00:57:36.500 --> 00:57:36.780
Also—
还有——

1536
00:57:36.780 --> 00:57:41.180
That you would Google map looking for yams in Carbondale?
你有没有想过自己会用谷歌地图在卡本代尔搜山药？

1537
00:57:41.360 --> 00:57:44.020
This is the kind of stuff we do for you guys.
这就是我们为你们做的这些事。

1538
00:57:44.020 --> 00:57:48.880
This is—I'm allergic to yams and sweet potatoes, by the way.
顺便说一下，我对山药和红薯过敏。

1539
00:57:49.000 --> 00:57:54.820
So even if I had found them, I could never do anything for myself with this information.
所以即使我找到了，我也无法利用这些信息为自己做任何事。

1540
00:57:54.820 --> 00:57:56.180
This was all for you.
这一切都是为了你们。

1541
00:57:56.200 --> 00:57:56.880
All for you.
全是为了你们。

1542
00:57:57.060 --> 00:57:59.200
Next in this episode, Dwight collapses.
这一集的接下来，德怀特晕倒了。

1543
00:57:59.200 --> 00:58:01.160
He needs to go to the hospital.
他需要去医院。

1544
00:58:01.840 --> 00:58:07.580
And while we're walking to the elevator, Dwight says, it smells like chicken soup.
当我们走向电梯时，德怀特说，闻起来像鸡汤。

1545
00:58:07.740 --> 00:58:09.280
And Pam says, I know.
帕姆说，我知道。

1546
00:58:09.500 --> 00:58:10.620
That was improvised.
那是即兴发挥的。

1547
00:58:10.840 --> 00:58:15.080
The amount of scripted words that they had for us did not get us to the elevator.
剧本里给我们的台词量不足以支撑我们走到电梯口。

1548
00:58:15.540 --> 00:58:18.140
So they told us, just say some stuff.
所以他们告诉我们，随便说点什么。

1549
00:58:18.800 --> 00:58:22.100
And I loved shooting this scene with Rain.
我很喜欢和雷恩拍这场戏。

1550
00:58:22.280 --> 00:58:23.020
It was so much fun.
真的太有趣了。

1551
00:58:23.020 --> 00:58:23.780
It looked like it.
看起来确实是这样。

1552
00:58:23.860 --> 00:58:25.560
It looked like you were having a good time.
看起来你玩得很开心。

1553
00:58:25.660 --> 00:58:26.660
I really liked it.
我真的很喜欢。

1554
00:58:26.660 --> 00:58:31.920
Also, I think he improvised that line where Jim says, what are you doing?
另外，我觉得吉姆说“你在干什么？”那句台词是他即兴发挥的。

1555
00:58:32.080 --> 00:58:36.480
And he says, making Vietnam sounds or something like that as he's falling on the couch.
然后他说“制造越南声效”之类的，当时他正倒在沙发上。

1556
00:58:37.040 --> 00:58:37.240
Yes.
没错。

1557
00:58:37.520 --> 00:58:42.400
But I did want to say something that was not improvised that's in the script is the water
但我确实想说，剧本里有一处不是即兴发挥的，就是吉姆从植物上拿起水瓶

1558
00:58:42.400 --> 00:58:46.680
bottle that Jim picks up off of the plant and then is spraying him.
然后喷向他。

1559
00:58:46.860 --> 00:58:47.860
That was in the scene.
那是剧本里有的。

1560
00:58:48.060 --> 00:58:49.240
Well, I have a question.
好吧，我有个问题。

1561
00:58:49.400 --> 00:58:49.640
Yeah.
嗯。

1562
00:58:49.980 --> 00:58:51.780
At 15 minutes, 25 seconds.
在15分25秒的时候。

1563
00:58:51.880 --> 00:58:52.020
Yeah.
嗯。

1564
00:58:53.200 --> 00:58:53.640
Why?
为什么？

1565
00:58:53.900 --> 00:58:56.000
Why do they have to go in Meredith's van?
为什么他们非得坐梅瑞狄斯的车？

1566
00:58:56.000 --> 00:58:58.660
So many fans wrote in about that.
很多粉丝都写信问过这个问题。

1567
00:58:58.660 --> 00:59:00.100
Why couldn't they go in Jim's car?
为什么他们不能坐吉姆的车？

1568
00:59:00.220 --> 00:59:01.800
I get why Michael can't drive.
我明白迈克尔为什么不能开车。

1569
00:59:02.100 --> 00:59:03.820
I get that Dwight can't drive.
我明白德怀特为什么不能开车。

1570
00:59:04.340 --> 00:59:07.280
But Jim, why didn't Jim say, Meredith, that's fine.
但吉姆，为什么吉姆不直接说：“梅瑞狄斯，没关系。”

1571
00:59:07.280 --> 00:59:09.120
I don't want to ride in your gross van.
“我不想坐你那辆恶心的车。”

1572
00:59:09.160 --> 00:59:10.380
I'll take my car.
“我自己开车去。”

1573
00:59:10.500 --> 00:59:11.560
Here are his choices.
他当时的选择是这样的。

1574
00:59:12.160 --> 00:59:16.140
Go in Meredith's van or put Dwight and Michael in his car.
要么坐梅瑞狄斯的车，要么让德怀特和迈克尔坐他的车。

1575
00:59:17.320 --> 00:59:19.820
Dwight has already thrown up.
德怀特已经吐了。

1576
00:59:19.960 --> 00:59:20.820
I mean, I don't know.
我是说，我也不知道。

1577
00:59:20.940 --> 00:59:22.500
Would you put them in your car?
你会让他们坐你的车吗？

1578
00:59:22.500 --> 00:59:28.140
Yes, I would rather drive my car, an injured person in my car, where I know my car.
会，我宁愿开自己的车，载着伤员，毕竟我更熟悉自己的车。

1579
00:59:28.440 --> 00:59:29.840
Meredith's van is a hot mess.
梅瑞狄斯的车简直是一团糟。

1580
00:59:30.020 --> 00:59:34.180
But because they took Meredith's van, they had that great funny scene of Dwight trying
但正因为他们坐了梅瑞狄斯的车，才有了德怀特在后座试图喝朗姆酒那段超级搞笑的戏。

1581
00:59:34.180 --> 00:59:35.940
to drink the rum in the backseat.
天哪。

1582
00:59:36.100 --> 00:59:36.740
Oh, my gosh.
约翰在采访中说过，那是他在剧组拍摄时笑场最严重的一次，就是在拍梅瑞狄斯车里的那些戏份。

1583
00:59:36.940 --> 00:59:41.460
So John has said in interviews that that was one of the hardest times he's ever laughed
嗯，我觉得这三个人，只要他们聚在一起坐车，就会笑得停不下来。

1584
00:59:41.460 --> 00:59:44.380
on the show, was filming those Meredith's van scenes.
你看过他们笑得前仰后合的那些花絮了吗？

1585
00:59:44.760 --> 00:59:48.700
Well, I think these three guys, whenever they get in a car together, they lose it.
看过。

1586
00:59:48.700 --> 00:59:52.540
Have you seen all the outtakes of them laughing their butts off?
就像在这些车里那样？

1587
00:59:52.640 --> 00:59:52.860
Yes.
而且我觉得，那是约翰，不是吉姆。

1588
00:59:53.020 --> 00:59:53.880
Like in these cars?
那是约翰拿着那个喷水瓶。

1589
00:59:54.080 --> 00:59:57.520
And also, I think that John, it wasn't Jim.
噢，他玩得太开心了。

1590
00:59:57.760 --> 00:59:59.880
That was John with that spray bottle.
他玩得太开心了。

1591
01:00:00.080 --> 01:00:01.420
Oh, he had too much fun with that.
我们不能结束这一集，除非我聊聊迈克尔最让我喜欢的一点，

1592
01:00:01.420 --> 01:00:02.520
He had too much fun with that.
那就是当他解释一些我们都知道的事情时，他表现得好像是他发明了这件事，或者他是唯一知道这件事的人。

1593
01:00:02.580 --> 01:00:06.980
We can't end this episode without me talking about one of my favorite things that Michael
“副驾座”。

1594
01:00:06.980 --> 01:00:11.800
does is when he explains something that we all know, but he explains it to you as if he's
天哪。

1595
01:00:11.800 --> 01:00:14.360
the person that invented it or he's the only one that knows it.
在16分38秒的时候，他说，“副驾座的规则非常简单明了。”

1596
01:00:14.520 --> 01:00:14.920
Shotgun.
每当他做这种事，我简直太爱看了。

1597
01:00:15.120 --> 01:00:15.900
Oh, my gosh.
噢，天哪。

1598
01:00:15.900 --> 01:00:20.960
So at 16 minutes, 38 seconds, he goes, the rules of Shotgun are very simple and very
所以，在16分38秒时，他说，“副驾座的规则非常简单明了。”

1599
01:00:20.960 --> 01:00:21.340
clear.
每当他做这种事，我简直太爱看了。

1600
01:00:22.060 --> 01:00:24.540
Whenever he does this stuff, I just live for it.
每当他做这种事，我简直太爱看了。

1601
01:00:24.660 --> 01:00:25.340
I love it.
我喜欢这个。

1602
01:00:25.640 --> 01:00:26.520
I love it.
我喜欢这个。

1603
01:00:27.120 --> 01:00:29.780
In this episode, we learn Dwight's middle name.
在这一集中，我们知道了德怀特中间名的含义。

1604
01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:31.080
Is not Danger.
不是“危险”。

1605
01:00:31.380 --> 01:00:31.940
It's Kurt.
是“库尔特”。

1606
01:00:32.660 --> 01:00:37.680
But fan question from Brianna, was Dwight saying his middle name Danger scripted or improvised?
但布里安娜有个粉丝提问，德怀特说他中间名是“危险”是剧本写的还是即兴发挥的？

1607
01:00:37.680 --> 01:00:38.620
It was scripted.
是剧本写的。

1608
01:00:39.240 --> 01:00:44.360
We also learn in this episode, you guys, that Creed as a teenager was in an iron lung.
大家，我们还在这一集中了解到，克里德十几岁时曾住过铁肺。

1609
01:00:44.360 --> 01:00:46.320
He says he was in an iron lung.
他说他住过铁肺。

1610
01:00:47.200 --> 01:00:49.200
Not that he had an iron lung, that he was, what?
不是说他拥有一个铁肺，而是说他，怎么说呢？

1611
01:00:49.460 --> 01:00:50.880
Like he's in an iron lung.
就像他待在铁肺里一样。

1612
01:00:50.980 --> 01:00:51.680
That's what they are.
那就是它们的样子。

1613
01:00:51.740 --> 01:00:51.880
That's the thing.
就是那个东西。

1614
01:00:52.040 --> 01:00:52.480
You went inside.
你钻进去了。

1615
01:00:52.480 --> 01:00:55.200
Yeah, you went inside of a thing called an iron lung, I guess.
对，我想你是钻进了一个叫铁肺的东西里面。

1616
01:00:55.320 --> 01:00:56.380
I don't know how it works.
我不知道它是怎么运作的。

1617
01:00:56.500 --> 01:00:57.000
I don't either.
我也不知道。

1618
01:00:57.000 --> 01:00:58.720
I did not deep dive on iron lungs.
我没去深究铁肺到底是什么。

1619
01:00:58.900 --> 01:00:59.980
I loved it, though.
不过我挺喜欢的。

1620
01:01:00.160 --> 01:01:02.600
I loved when Jim's like, how old are you?
我喜欢吉姆问他“你多大了”的那一段。

1621
01:01:02.840 --> 01:01:04.000
Or no, that was Michael.
不对，那是迈克尔。

1622
01:01:04.140 --> 01:01:05.540
When Michael was like, how old are you?
当迈克尔问“你多大了”的时候。

1623
01:01:05.540 --> 01:01:10.260
But anyway, we learned that Creed was in an iron lung as a teenager, which is hilarious.
但不管怎样，我们了解到克里德十几岁时住过铁肺，这太搞笑了。

1624
01:01:10.840 --> 01:01:16.060
I love in this episode that Michael takes off his microphone.
我喜欢这一集中迈克尔摘掉麦克风的桥段。

1625
01:01:16.300 --> 01:01:16.680
Yes.
没错。

1626
01:01:16.820 --> 01:01:19.020
This is the first time we go radio silent, right?
这是我们第一次进入“无线电静默”状态，对吧？

1627
01:01:19.020 --> 01:01:19.600
I think so.
我想是吧。

1628
01:01:19.720 --> 01:01:21.700
That we point out that we're actually miked.
我们第一次指出我们其实戴着麦克风。

1629
01:01:21.840 --> 01:01:23.600
We sort of break that fourth wall in that way.
我们以那种方式打破了第四面墙。

1630
01:01:23.720 --> 01:01:23.900
Yeah.
是啊。

1631
01:01:24.400 --> 01:01:25.460
I liked that.
我喜欢那个。

1632
01:01:25.720 --> 01:01:28.240
And then I love this scene.
然后我喜欢这一幕。

1633
01:01:28.240 --> 01:01:30.480
And this scene was not in the script.
这一幕不在剧本里。

1634
01:01:30.800 --> 01:01:34.020
In our shooting draft of the script, they must have added this later.
在我们拍摄用的剧本草稿里，他们一定是后来加进去的。

1635
01:01:34.020 --> 01:01:36.820
I mean, probably while we were shooting.
我是说，可能是在我们拍摄的时候。

1636
01:01:37.140 --> 01:01:44.860
But this scene where Jim calls Pam and Angela pops her head over to overhear if there's any news about Dwight.
就是吉姆给帕姆打电话，安吉拉探出头来偷听有没有关于德怀特的消息的那一幕。

1637
01:01:45.080 --> 01:01:46.720
And Pam clocks it.
帕姆注意到了。

1638
01:01:47.440 --> 01:01:56.640
And then Pam goes over to Oscar and tells Oscar, hey, Oscar, I thought you'd like to know Dwight's going to be okay.
然后帕姆走到奥斯卡身边告诉他：“嘿，奥斯卡，我想你可能想知道德怀特会没事的。”

1639
01:01:57.080 --> 01:01:59.640
And it zooms in on your face.
镜头拉近到你的脸上。

1640
01:02:00.240 --> 01:02:01.780
And you're so relieved.
你看起来如释重负。

1641
01:02:01.780 --> 01:02:05.740
And you can tell you're in love.
看得出来你坠入爱河了。

1642
01:02:05.920 --> 01:02:06.540
I'm in love.
我坠入爱河了。

1643
01:02:06.600 --> 01:02:07.700
I was worried about my man.
我当时很担心我的男人。

1644
01:02:07.860 --> 01:02:15.600
One of the things I did, and we all did this in different ways as characters, if something interesting was happening at reception,
我做过的一件事，我们所有角色都以不同的方式做过，如果前台发生了什么有趣的事，

1645
01:02:15.840 --> 01:02:21.680
even if it wasn't in my script that my character clocked it, I would just pop up and look over the partition.
即使剧本没写我的角色注意到了，我也会探出头去看看隔板那边。

1646
01:02:22.140 --> 01:02:27.060
And the first time one of the camera guys caught me doing it, the writers loved this.
第一次被摄影师拍到我这样做时，编剧们很喜欢。

1647
01:02:27.420 --> 01:02:28.960
And that kind of became a thing.
然后这就成了一个惯例。

1648
01:02:29.300 --> 01:02:34.500
So, of course, if Pam is on the phone about Dwight, I'm going to pop my head over.
所以，如果帕姆在电话里谈论德怀特，我当然会探头过去。

1649
01:02:34.740 --> 01:02:38.600
But this one was scripted, that my head's there, that I'm listening in.
但这一幕是剧本写好的，写了我探出头去偷听。

1650
01:02:39.200 --> 01:02:44.400
And I remember one of the things they told me is that they're going to catch my head at the top.
我记得他们告诉过我，他们会拍到我的头顶。

1651
01:02:44.880 --> 01:02:45.980
It's not a ton of time.
时间不多了。

1652
01:02:46.120 --> 01:02:48.600
Pam's going to look back over, and then I need to, like, disappear.
帕姆会回头看，然后我就得，怎么说呢，消失掉。

1653
01:02:48.600 --> 01:02:49.040
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1654
01:02:49.180 --> 01:02:49.480
Right?
对吧？

1655
01:02:49.660 --> 01:02:53.500
Like, I – and so we were playing around with this.
就像，我——所以我们当时在试着玩这个。

1656
01:02:53.560 --> 01:02:56.520
So in one take, when you look back over, I just dropped to my knees.
所以在拍其中一条时，当你回头看的时候，我直接跪下了。

1657
01:02:56.900 --> 01:02:58.340
Do you notice how quickly?
你注意到有多快了吗？

1658
01:02:58.480 --> 01:02:59.140
You really do.
你确实注意到了。

1659
01:02:59.360 --> 01:03:03.120
And that's the one I think they kept in because I just, like, dropped like a rock.
我觉得他们保留了那一条，因为我当时就像块石头一样直接倒下了。

1660
01:03:03.300 --> 01:03:04.740
And they thought that was really funny.
他们觉得那特别好笑。

1661
01:03:04.740 --> 01:03:16.160
The very end of this, it's the final shot of Dwight in the CT scan machine, and Michael tries to put his foot in.
这一幕的最后，是德怀特在CT扫描仪里的最后一个镜头，迈克尔试图把脚伸进去。

1662
01:03:16.680 --> 01:03:17.980
That was not in the script.
剧本里没这一出。

1663
01:03:18.160 --> 01:03:20.960
That was an improvisation by Mr. Steve Carell.
那是史蒂夫·卡瑞尔先生的即兴发挥。

1664
01:03:21.040 --> 01:03:21.740
Of course.
当然了。

1665
01:03:21.920 --> 01:03:22.520
Of course.
当然了。

1666
01:03:22.680 --> 01:03:27.140
So we learn in this episode that Dwight with a concussion is actually really a likable guy.
所以我们在这一集里了解到，脑震荡的德怀特其实是个挺讨人喜欢的人。

1667
01:03:27.320 --> 01:03:27.540
Yeah.
是啊。

1668
01:03:27.680 --> 01:03:30.000
But he also steps out of his lane a little.
但他也有点越界了。

1669
01:03:30.180 --> 01:03:31.500
With Pam, he becomes a friend.
他和帕姆成了朋友。

1670
01:03:31.620 --> 01:03:32.380
Jim didn't like that.
吉姆不喜欢那样。

1671
01:03:32.380 --> 01:03:36.420
And then he gets the jokes instead of Michael with the doctor.
然后他和医生开玩笑，而不是迈克尔。

1672
01:03:36.680 --> 01:03:37.880
And Michael didn't like that.
迈克尔也不喜欢那样。

1673
01:03:38.440 --> 01:03:39.980
And, you know, I don't know.
而且，你知道，我不知道。

1674
01:03:40.120 --> 01:03:42.500
I thought he was so adorable in this episode.
我觉得他在这一集里太可爱了。

1675
01:03:42.740 --> 01:03:50.520
Well, a lot of people pointed out that there are going to be some future episodes that follow the Pam and Dwight friendship.
嗯，很多人指出，以后的剧集里会有一些帕姆和德怀特友谊的发展。

1676
01:03:50.820 --> 01:03:57.000
And spoiler alert, in the end, Dwight calls Pam one of his best friends or his best friend.
剧透预警，最后德怀特称帕姆是他最好的朋友之一，或者是他最好的朋友。

1677
01:03:57.180 --> 01:03:57.680
I know.
我知道。

1678
01:03:58.020 --> 01:03:59.080
And it's really sweet.
真的很暖心。

1679
01:03:59.180 --> 01:04:01.840
And I absolutely loved these.
我特别喜欢这些情节。

1680
01:04:01.840 --> 01:04:05.500
I love whenever Pam and Dwight have to team up.
我喜欢帕姆和德怀特联手的时候。

1681
01:04:05.660 --> 01:04:13.100
I think something about Pam that's true is that for as much as Dwight and or Michael annoy her, she really loves them.
我觉得帕姆身上有一点是真的，那就是尽管德怀特或迈克尔让她很烦，但她其实很爱他们。

1682
01:04:13.420 --> 01:04:14.440
Like, she does.
真的，她是这样。

1683
01:04:14.680 --> 01:04:18.560
They're her crazy cousin or zany uncle or whatever.
他们就像她的疯狂表亲或古怪叔叔之类的。

1684
01:04:19.000 --> 01:04:20.760
But she loves them.
但她爱他们。

1685
01:04:20.960 --> 01:04:22.020
She does love them.
她是真的爱他们。

1686
01:04:22.240 --> 01:04:24.600
I have to think that Angela does not.
我得认为安吉拉可不这么想。

1687
01:04:25.260 --> 01:04:27.620
If Angela doesn't like you, she doesn't like you.
如果安吉拉不喜欢你，她是真的不喜欢你。

1688
01:04:27.620 --> 01:04:28.480
She doesn't like you.
她是真的不喜欢你。

1689
01:04:28.480 --> 01:04:34.840
And I have to think that it was probably like a source of conflict for her and Dwight if Dwight was like, well, you know, Pam was kind of – I'm like, oh, Pam.
我得认为如果德怀特说，嗯，你知道，帕姆其实挺——我心想，噢，帕姆，这对他和安吉拉来说可能是一个矛盾的来源。

1690
01:04:35.280 --> 01:04:40.520
You know, I'm going to say I think the one person that Pam maybe didn't like was Angela.
你知道，我想说，我觉得帕姆唯一可能不喜欢的人就是安吉拉。

1691
01:04:40.760 --> 01:04:41.260
I know.
我知道。

1692
01:04:42.260 --> 01:04:49.940
Like, I think she – you know, but she'll take the if you have nothing good to say, say nothing at all about Angela.
我觉得她——你知道，但对于安吉拉，她会遵循“如果你说不出什么好话，那就什么也别说”的原则。

1693
01:04:50.500 --> 01:04:52.460
Yeah, but I really don't think they liked each other.
是啊，但我真的觉得她们互相不喜欢。

1694
01:04:52.460 --> 01:04:53.500
I don't think they did.
我觉得她们确实不喜欢对方。

1695
01:04:53.600 --> 01:04:54.320
Which is hilarious.
这太搞笑了。

1696
01:04:54.320 --> 01:05:02.740
If you have the DVDs and want to watch a really great deleted scene from this episode, my personal favorite is the scene where Jim and Michael,
如果你有DVD，想看这一集里一个非常棒的删减片段，我个人最喜欢的是吉姆和迈克尔的那场戏，

1697
01:05:02.740 --> 01:05:05.860
they are in the waiting room of the emergency room.
他们在急诊室的候诊室里。

1698
01:05:06.040 --> 01:05:06.360
Oh.
噢。

1699
01:05:06.620 --> 01:05:07.520
Dwight is in the back.
德怀特在后面。

1700
01:05:07.660 --> 01:05:08.960
They're waiting in this lobby.
他们在大厅里等着。

1701
01:05:09.220 --> 01:05:10.020
I watched this.
我看了这个。

1702
01:05:10.040 --> 01:05:11.740
They're watching a telenovela.
他们正在看一部肥皂剧。

1703
01:05:12.540 --> 01:05:14.360
And it just made me laugh.
这让我忍不住笑了。

1704
01:05:14.580 --> 01:05:17.860
They're just stuck in this hospital waiting room watching a telenovela.
他们被困在医院候诊室里看肥皂剧。

1705
01:05:17.920 --> 01:05:19.080
And I loved it.
我太喜欢了。

1706
01:05:19.380 --> 01:05:21.060
Well, guys, that's the injury.
好吧，伙计们，这就是伤情。

1707
01:05:21.380 --> 01:05:22.240
That's the injury.
这就是伤情。

1708
01:05:22.240 --> 01:05:25.580
Angela did this podcast with an injury.
安吉拉带着伤录了这期播客。

1709
01:05:25.660 --> 01:05:27.680
That's how method she is.
她就是这么敬业。

1710
01:05:28.260 --> 01:05:32.220
Do you think you subconsciously gave yourself an injury for the injury?
你觉得你是潜意识里为了配合伤情而让自己受伤的吗？

1711
01:05:32.480 --> 01:05:33.000
No.
没有。

1712
01:05:33.800 --> 01:05:34.200
No.
没有。

1713
01:05:34.500 --> 01:05:35.900
I think I can't –
我想我不能——

1714
01:05:35.900 --> 01:05:36.420
Mind meld?
心意相通？

1715
01:05:36.520 --> 01:05:39.700
I think I can't chew gum when I'm having a sassy rant.
我想我在发牢骚的时候不能嚼口香糖。

1716
01:05:39.700 --> 01:05:42.320
I was venting poppin' gum.
我当时一边嚼着口香糖一边发泄。

1717
01:05:42.580 --> 01:05:43.560
It's probably karma.
这大概是报应吧。

1718
01:05:44.880 --> 01:05:45.820
I don't know.
我不知道。

1719
01:05:45.940 --> 01:05:46.500
I don't know.
我不知道。

1720
01:05:46.680 --> 01:05:48.760
I think maybe you did it for the show.
我觉得你可能是为了节目才这么做的。

1721
01:05:48.940 --> 01:05:49.960
Well, listen.
好吧，听着。

1722
01:05:50.180 --> 01:05:50.640
Thank you.
谢谢你。

1723
01:05:50.820 --> 01:05:51.320
Thank you.
谢谢你。

1724
01:05:51.340 --> 01:05:52.120
You were excellent today.
你今天表现得太棒了。

1725
01:05:52.120 --> 01:05:52.680
You're welcome.
不客气。

1726
01:05:53.080 --> 01:05:59.300
Guys, next week we'll be back with The Secret, where we very much do propel the Jim Pam storyline forward.
伙计们，下周我们将回归《秘密》那一集，届时我们将大力推进吉姆和帕姆的故事线。

1727
01:05:59.860 --> 01:06:03.820
Can Michael keep the secret that Jim told him on the booze cruise?
迈克尔能守住吉姆在酒会上告诉他的秘密吗？

1728
01:06:04.060 --> 01:06:04.700
The secret.
秘密。

1729
01:06:05.000 --> 01:06:05.780
The secret.
秘密。

1730
01:06:06.360 --> 01:06:06.920
Secret.
秘密。

1731
01:06:07.480 --> 01:06:08.980
My side of my tongue is numb.
我舌头的一侧麻了。

1732
01:06:09.280 --> 01:06:09.560
Secret.
秘密。

1733
01:06:10.100 --> 01:06:11.920
Angela's tongue will be better next week.
安吉拉的舌头下周就会好起来的。

1734
01:06:12.180 --> 01:06:13.140
It's a good thing.
这是件好事。

1735
01:06:14.340 --> 01:06:15.360
See you then.
到时见。

1736
01:06:15.480 --> 01:06:15.760
Bye.
再见。

1737
